			<p style="text-align: justify;"><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-ansi-language:EN-US">The Issuers are legal entities seeking financial resources to attend their particular plans in the short, medium and long terms, for which they have the possibility of obtaining financing through the issuance of securities, whether debt or stocks.</span></p>
